# The Passage of Time

## Methods of advancing time

### Single player

Single player is perhaps the simplest when it comes to tracking time: An advancement of time can come whenever is convienient. If a player chooses to take a long rest, they do, and the game advances. If the DM decides time has passed and it is now night, it simply occurs. Time is fully in the hands of the player and the dm.

Advancement of time through a clock is possible but not manditory. Often the narrative determines the advancement of time, rather than the advancement of time determining the narrative.

